type: dataset
title: "State Atlas of Hospital Resistance and Small Hospitals"
abstract: "An open state-by-year table (50 states, District of Columbia and Puerto Rico, 2011-2024) joining CDC Antimicrobial Resistance & Patient Safety Portal percent resistance for MRSA, carbapenem-resistant Enterobacterales and vancomycin-resistant enterococci to counts of active short-term acute care and critical access hospitals by bed size and rural location from the CMS Provider of Services file, with a public state map."
